#: .\templates\about\about.html:11
msgid "About Speedy Mail Software"
msgstr "Speedy Mail Software-i buruz"

#: .\templates\about\about.html:15
msgid ""
"Speedy Mail Software will be a free software and open source web-based email"
" such as Gmail. We want the mail to be as similar as possible to the "
"excellent email of Google, Gmail. When we develop such a mail software, we "
"intend to run a free email service to all members of Speedy Net, so that the"
" username of each person at Speedy Net + the speedy.net domain name will be "
"the email address of the user. In the past we operated an email like this, "
"but unfortunately we had to close it because it was a lot worse than Gmail, "
"in terms of features and storage, and also because we were not able to "
"control the problem of spam (\"junk mail\") sent to our clients. But if we "
"can recruit volunteers to create a good email program, we will reactivate "
"Speedy Mail and will allow any company or organization to operate a similar "
"web-based email on their site."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Mail Software Gmail bezalako web bidezko posta elektroniko libre eta "
"kode irekikoa izango da. Posta Google-ren posta bikaina, Gmail, ahalik eta "
"antzekoena izatea nahi dugu. Posta-software hori garatzen dugunean, Speedy "
"Net-eko kide guztientzako posta elektroniko zerbitzu doakoa martxan jartzeko"
" asmoa dugu, Speedy Net-eko pertsona bakoitzaren erabiltzaile-izena + "
"speedy.net domeinu-izena erabiltzailearen helbide elektronikoa izan dadin. "
"Iraganean horrelako posta bat eskaini genuen, baina zoritxarrez itxi behar "
"izan genuen, Gmail baino askoz okerragoa zelako ezaugarrien eta "
"biltegiratzearen aldetik, eta bezeroei bidalitako spam-arazoa (\"zabor-"
"posta\") kontrolatu ezin genuelako ere. Hala ere, posta-programa on bat "
"sortzeko boluntarioak lortzen baditugu, Speedy Mail berriro aktibatuko dugu "
"eta edozein enpresak edo erakundek antzeko web-posta bat bere gunean martxan"
" jartzea baimenduko dugu."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:17
msgid ""
"Speedy Mail Software will be available in two languages - English and "
"Hebrew, and will be free of charge. Speedy Net and Speedy Mail Software are "
"free software & open source projects. If you want to help developing Speedy "
"Mail Software, please contact me by email."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Mail Software bi hizkuntzatan egongo da eskuragarri, ingelesez eta "
"hebreeraz, eta doakoa izango da. Speedy Net eta Speedy Mail Software "
"software librea eta kode irekiko proiektuak dira. Speedy Mail Software "
"garatzen laguntzea nahi baduzu, jarri nirekin harremanetan posta "
"elektronikoz."

#: .\templates\about\about.html:19
msgid ""
"Speedy Mail Software is named after <a "
"href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the.female.dog\" "
"title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a>, a female dog that was with us for many years "
"and died in 2003. Speedy gave birth to 7 puppies in 1988."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Mail Software <a "
"href=\"https://www.facebook.com/speedy.the.female.dog\" "
"title=\"Speedy\">Speedy</a> txakurrari ezarri zitzaion izena; urte askotan "
"gurekin egon zen eta 2003an hil zen. Speedy-k 7 txakurkume izan zituen "
"1988an."

