#: .\templates\main\main_page.html:9
msgid ""
"We are looking for volunteers to help us develop Speedy Mail Software, a "
"free software and open source web-based email such as Gmail."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Mail Software garatzen laguntzeko boluntarioak bilatzen ari gara, "
"Gmail bezalako web bidezko posta elektroniko libre eta kode irekikoa."

#: .\templates\main\main_page.html:15
msgid "Welcome to Speedy Mail Software!"
msgstr "Ongi etorri Speedy Mail Software-ra!"

#: .\templates\main\main_page.html:19
msgid ""
"We are looking for volunteers to help us develop Speedy Mail Software, a "
"free software and open source web-based email such as Gmail. We want the "
"mail to be as similar as possible to the excellent email of Google, Gmail. "
"When we develop such a mail software, we intend to run a free email service "
"to all members of Speedy Net, so that the username of each person at Speedy "
"Net + the speedy.net domain name will be the email address of the user. In "
"the past we operated an email like this, but unfortunately we had to close "
"it because it was a lot worse than Gmail, in terms of features and storage, "
"and also because we were not able to control the problem of spam (\"junk "
"mail\") sent to our clients. But if we can recruit volunteers to create a "
"good email program, we will reactivate Speedy Mail and will allow any "
"company or organization to operate a similar web-based email on their site."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Mail Software garatzen laguntzeko boluntarioak bilatzen ari gara, "
"Gmail bezalako web bidezko posta elektroniko libre eta kode irekikoa. Posta "
"Google-ren posta bikaina, Gmail, ahalik eta antzekoena izatea nahi dugu. "
"Posta-software hori garatzen dugunean, Speedy Net-eko kide guztientzako "
"posta elektroniko zerbitzu doakoa martxan jartzeko asmoa dugu, Speedy Net-"
"eko pertsona bakoitzaren erabiltzaile-izena + speedy.net domeinu-izena "
"erabiltzailearen helbide elektronikoa izan dadin. Iraganean horrelako posta "
"bat eskaini genuen, baina zoritxarrez itxi behar izan genuen, Gmail baino "
"askoz okerragoa zelako ezaugarrien eta biltegiratzearen aldetik, eta "
"bezeroei bidalitako spam-arazoa (\"zabor-posta\") kontrolatu ezin genuelako "
"ere. Hala ere, posta-programa on bat sortzeko boluntarioak lortzen baditugu,"
" Speedy Mail berriro aktibatuko dugu eta edozein enpresak edo erakundek "
"antzeko web-posta bat bere gunean martxan jartzea baimenduko dugu."

#: .\templates\main\main_page.html:21
msgid ""
"Speedy Mail Software will use the Python and JavaScript languages. Speedy "
"Net is also free software and open source. If you are interested in "
"volunteering, please contact me by email."
msgstr ""
"Speedy Mail Software-k Python eta JavaScript lengoaiak erabiliko ditu. "
"Speedy Net ere software librea eta kode irekikoa da. Boluntario lanetan "
"aritzeko interesa baduzu, jarri nirekin harremanetan posta elektronikoz."